WEBVTT

00:00:00.034 --> 00:00:04.070
Look of the day! Aubergine jacket, black roll-neck. Let’s see.

00:00:04.120 --> 00:00:05.717
The jacket? Short, suede.

00:00:05.767 --> 00:00:08.947
The colours? Aubergine, black, charcoal. Perfect.

00:00:08.997 --> 00:00:10.660
The trousers? Wide, sharp.

00:00:10.710 --> 00:00:15.471
And look at this: the roll-neck under the jacket. That’s a man who knows.

00:00:15.521 --> 00:00:19.359
But… the sleeves. Too short, his wife noticed! One size up!

00:00:19.409 --> 00:00:21.139
Elegance… is in the detail.

00:00:21.189 --> 00:00:22.061
Overall score?

00:00:22.111 --> 00:00:24.236
And you, what would you give him?
